              <tr>
                <td>
                  <a name="x-https://dsacms.github.io/cmmi-access-model/CodeSystem/ACCESSAlignmentResultCS-aligned-switch-approved"> </a>
                  <code>https://dsacms.github.io/cmmi-access-model/CodeSystem/ACCESSAlignmentResultCS</code>
                </td>
                <td style="white-space:nowrap">  
                  <a href="CodeSystem-ACCESSAlignmentResultCS.html#ACCESSAlignmentResultCS-aligned-switch-approved">aligned-switch-approved</a>
                </td>
                <td>Aligned and switch approved</td>
                <td>The request to switch the patient's alignment from a different participant after the 90-day lock in period is accepted and the patient is considered switched and now re-aligned.</td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;https://dsacms.github.io/cmmi-access-model/CodeSystem/ACCESSAlignmentResultCS&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;0.9.11&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;aligned-switch-approved&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;Aligned and switch approved&quot;}" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
                  </span>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="&lt;coding&gt;&lt;system value=&quot;https://dsacms.github.io/cmmi-access-model/CodeSystem/ACCESSAlignmentResultCS&quot;&gt;&lt;version value=&quot;0.9.11&quot;&gt;&lt;code value=&quot;aligned-switch-approved&quot;&gt;&lt;display value=&quot;Aligned and switch approved&quot;&gt;&lt;/coding&gt;" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
                  </span>
                </td>
              </tr>
              <tr>
                <td>
                  <a name="x-https://dsacms.github.io/cmmi-access-model/CodeSystem/ACCESSAlignmentResultCS-not-aligned-control-group"> </a>
