                </td>
                <td style="white-space:nowrap">  
                  <a href="CodeSystem-ACCESSReportTypeCS.html#ACCESSReportTypeCS-quarterly">quarterly</a>
                </td>
                <td>Quarterly Data Report</td>
                <td>
                  <div>
                    <p>Reports quarterly Outcome-Aligned Payment (OAP) data for the patient. Valid quarterly OAP Measures must be submitted 70 to 110 days after the prior OAP
submission</p>

                  </div>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;https://dsacms.github.io/cmmi-access-model/CodeSystem/ACCESSReportTypeCS&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;0.9.11&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;quarterly&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;Quarterly Data Report&quot;}" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
