                </td>
                <td style="white-space:nowrap">  
                  <a href="CodeSystem-ACCESSReportTypeCS.html#ACCESSReportTypeCS-end-of-period">end-of-period</a>
                </td>
                <td>End of Period Data Report</td>
                <td>
                  <div>
                    <p>Reports end of period Outcome-Aligned Payment (OAP) data for the patient. Valid end-of-period measures must be submitted no later than 425 days from the date of alignment
(365 days plus an additional 60 days) and may be submitted up to 90 days prior to Day 365 for the
eCKM and CKM tracks or up to 180 days prior to Day 365 for the BH and MSK tracks (“early success reporting”).</p>

                  </div>
                </td>
                <td>
                  <span class="copy-text-inline">
                    <button data-clipboard-text="{&quot;system&quot;: &quot;https://dsacms.github.io/cmmi-access-model/CodeSystem/ACCESSReportTypeCS&quot;, &quot;version&quot;: &quot;0.9.11&quot;, &quot;code&quot;: &quot;end-of-period&quot;, &quot;display&quot;: &quot;End of Period Data Report&quot;}" title="Click to Copy as Coding" class="btn-copy"> </button>
